Production rollout for the AgentJob inclusive 60-second gate boundary fix and dynamic 0007 preflight.
The production-deploy workflow must run the complete test suite, deploy this exact merged main commit, and verify /health git_sha equals GITHUB_SHA before the guarded 0007 workflow is allowed to write. The 0007 workflow independently waits for that same SHA and a subsequent COMPLETED growth cycle with four source rows. This trigger authorizes only deployment of the tested Worker; it does not authorize D1 SQL, schema changes, deletion, or restore.
